0045:     - A red object carried by blue moves right until its bounding box touches the right edge of that blue region.
0046:     - A red object carried by teal moves left until its bounding box touches the left edge of that teal region.
0047:     - Preserve the object's shape and rows, and apply all object moves simultaneously.
